     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">#maptimeDavis is all about analyzing drone data this Monday, October 22nd, 2018 @ 1:00 – 3:00 pm in the DSI Classroom – room 360 Shields Library.  Taylor Nelsen will teach us how she processes her drone data for agricultural fields in a\r\n hands-on demonstration. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Prepare:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span>1.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">      \r\n</span></span><u></u>Register: <a href=\"https://spatial.ucdavis.edu/2018/10/15/maptimedavis-analyzing-drone-data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://spatial.ucdavis.edu/2018/10/15/maptimedavis-analyzing-drone-data/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466323564000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TaEmg0w-jEnTVA53nogr_\">\r\nhttps://spatial.ucdavis.edu/2018/10/15/maptimedavis-analyzing-drone-data/</a> <u></u>\r\n<u></u></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span>2.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">      \r\n</span></span><u></u>Bring a Laptop<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span>3.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">      \r\n</span></span><u></u>Install QGIS 2.18<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span>4.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">      \r\n</span></span><u></u>Install R or R Studio<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">See you Monday!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD                         \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">GIS Data Curator<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466323564000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26PAiOHSLsSa3IUVLJpHJ9\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">Data Management Program</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">161 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466323564000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VMTUZ-A-q8QWeRbSsEa6B\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">0000-0002-2954-8710</span></a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
